From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 00:07:18 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] adsldp: type info, IADs properties, Put/PutEx/GetEx/SetInfo,
 IDirectoryObject, search scrolling and preferences, system info, locks (3210)

Implements 42 of the 50 adsldp gap items (the unknown-IID QueryInterface
branches are triaged, DirSync/VLV search preferences escalated), and fixes
GetInfo/GetInfoEx reading the root DSE instead of the bound object. Gate
fastadsldp (64 and 32 bit) runs the provider against an in-process LDAP
server; each SG_MUTANT_ADS_* mutant fails it.

